# What graphify must NOT pull into the Knowledge Graph.
# graphify reads THIS file, not .claudeignore. The two ignore files have
# different audiences: .claudeignore narrows what Claude Code reads in chat;
# .graphifyignore narrows what /graphify ingests when (re)building the Brain.

